const individualArtworkEnhanceBase=enhanceMapView;enhanceMapView=function(){individualArtworkEnhanceBase();if(view==='maps'&&mapInteractionMode==='edit'&&mapInspectorTab==='arrange'){const m=currentMap(),o=m.objects.find(o=>o.id===mapSelection);if(o?.kind==='symbol')$('#mapInspector').insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend',`<details class="carto-detail" ${o.artworkFamily?'open':''}><summary>Artwork family</summary>${field('This object',`<select id="studioObjectArtwork"><option value="">Follow map’s artwork family</option>${Object.entries(MAP_PACKS).map(([id,p])=>`<option value="${id}" ${o.artworkFamily===id?'selected':''}>${esc(p.name)}</option>`).join('')}</select>`)}<p>The palette and lettering still follow the map. Remove this override to use the map’s family.</p></details>`);}};
